From 30a839dd28a10b8c6c71fe3cfbe29c501537458c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:19:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Bindings: displacement gradient option

C, Fortran, Python and Julia bindings of
FiniteStrainBehaviourOptions::gradient and of usesDisplacementGradient.
The C and Python tests load a Hencky behaviour with both gradients.
---
 bindings/c/include/MGIS/Behaviour/Behaviour.h | 38 +++++++++
 bindings/c/src/Behaviour.cxx                  | 46 +++++++++++
 bindings/c/tests/CMakeLists.txt               | 22 ++++++
 bindings/c/tests/DisplacementGradientTest-c.c | 76 ++++++++++++++++++
 bindings/fortran/src/mgis_behaviour.f90       | 79 +++++++++++++++++++
 bindings/julia/src/Behaviour.cxx              | 25 +++++-
 bindings/python/src/Behaviour.cxx             | 15 +++-
 bindings/python/tests/CMakeLists.txt          |  5 ++
 .../python/tests/DisplacementGradientTest.py  | 37 +++++++++
 9 files changed, 341 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 bindings/c/tests/DisplacementGradientTest-c.c
 create mode 100644 bindings/python/tests/DisplacementGradientTest.py

diff --git a/bindings/c/include/MGIS/Behaviour/Behaviour.h b/bindings/c/include/MGIS/Behaviour/Behaviour.h
